# Vercel Speed Insights - Already Installed

## Summary
Vercel Speed Insights is already fully installed and configured in this Astro project. The installation was completed in a previous pull request and is working correctly.

## Current Configuration

### Package Installation ✅
- `@vercel/speed-insights` version 2.0.0 is installed in package.json
- Dependencies are properly installed via npm
- package-lock.json is up to date

### Integration Status ✅
The SpeedInsights component is properly integrated in both layout files:

#### BaseLayout.astro (src/layouts/BaseLayout.astro)
```astro
import SpeedInsights from '@vercel/speed-insights/astro';
```
Component added before closing `</body>` tag: `<SpeedInsights />`

#### MinimalLayout.astro (src/layouts/MinimalLayout.astro)
```astro
import SpeedInsights from '@vercel/speed-insights/astro';
```
Component added before closing `</body>` tag: `<SpeedInsights />`

