## How It Works

### In Development
- Speed Insights does NOT track data (intentional behavior)
- Debug mode available if needed

### In Production (Vercel)
- Automatically tracks Web Vitals and performance metrics
- Data appears in Vercel dashboard under Speed Insights section
- Tracks: LCP, FID, CLS, FCP, TTFB, INP

## No Changes Required

The installation is complete and working correctly. No additional changes are needed.

